  m_text: Each resolved check has equal weight. Luck is actual minus expected, in
    percentage points (pp). Ties count as half; paired contests count once. Forced
    rolls, scatter/stoppage rolls and incomplete or unsupported records are excluded.
    This measures random outcomes, not manager skill or player ratings.
